silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_04_engine_spans_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '04EnginespansYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 04_engine_spans, the '] \\& |[schemanode]| DataRecord [d, arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens.; also, In the Music graph engine entry section 04_engine_spans, the emits arrow witnesses the DomesticCat classification arrow as a typed source leg into D_Mittens — NOT an identity onto Mittens." .
